	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>Disables Apple Intelligence features using com.apple.applicationaccess keys. Deprecated in macOS 26.4 in favour of declarative configurations; macOS 27 adds a Siri AI restriction in the declarative model only.</string>
